    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10729" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">contāmĭnātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		contamino (post-class.). <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A polluting, contamination, defilement</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mulieris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig.
					48, 5, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">expositionis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Arn. 5, 168</span></i>
			.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Corruption, disease</i>: ventris, Jul.
					<i><span class="en">Obseq. Prodig. 89</span></i>.</div>
